      "blocks": {
        "text-block-1": {
          "type": "text-block",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": true,
            "block_heading": "Do you offer custom jewelry design services?",
            "block_heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<p>Yes, we specialize in custom design services, allowing customers to collaborate with our designers to create truly unique and personalized jewelry pieces tailored to individual tastes and stories.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text-block-2": {
          "type": "text-block",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "block_heading": "Can I return or exchange an item I've purchased?",
            "block_heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely, we accept returns or exchanges within 30 days of purchase, provided the items are in their original condition and accompanied by a valid receipt, ensuring a hassle-free process for our customers.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text-block-3": {
          "type": "text-block",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "block_heading": "Do you have a warranty on your jewelry?",
            "block_heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<p>Indeed, every piece of our jewelry is backed by a one-year warranty, covering any manufacturing defects. This warranty reflects our commitment to quality and the enduring value of our products.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text-block-4": {
          "type": "text-block",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "block_heading": "Do you offer jewelry repair services?",
            "block_heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<p>Yes, our comprehensive repair services cater to all types of jewelry. Whether it's a simple cleaning or a complex repair, our skilled craftsmen ensure your cherished pieces are maintained and restored to their original beauty.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text-block-5": {
          "type": "text-block",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "block_heading": "Can I order online and pick up in-store?",
            "block_heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<p>Yes, customers have the option to order products online and select in-store pickup at checkout. This service allows combining the ease of online shopping with the personal touch of in-store service.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
